  "instructions": [
    "Heat the olive oil in a large kadhai over medium heat.",
    "Add the chopped onion and sauté until softened, about 5 minutes.",
    "Add the minced garlic and sauté for another minute.",
    "Add the cumin, coriander, cinnamon, turmeric, and red pepper flakes, and cook for 1 minute, stirring constantly.",
    "Add the split peas, salt, and black pepper, and stir to combine.",
    "Add the water and bring to a boil.",
    "Reduce the heat to low and simmer, covered, for 20 minutes, or until the peas are tender.",
    "Taste and adjust the seasoning as needed."
